OL,3,ABusiness groups urge Swinney to scrap
OL,4,A'ineffective' food price cap plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government's proposed food
OL,7,Fprice cap will be "ineffective",
OL,8,Fbusiness groups have told the first
OL,9,Fminister.
OL,11,FTwenty-three organisations have written
OL,12,Fa joint letter to John Swinney - who
OL,13,Fwill set out his programme for
OL,14,Fgovernment on Tuesday - urging him to
OL,15,Fscrap his plan for a legal cap on some
OL,16,Ffood and drink prices.
OL,18,FSignatories include groups representing
OL,19,Fretail, food and drink production,
OL,20,Fmanufacturing and distribution
OL,21,Fbusinesses in Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
