OL,3,ABusiness groups urge Swinney to scrap
OL,4,A'ineffective' food price cap plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the SNP's election manifesto it
OL,7,Fpledged to compel large supermarkets to
OL,8,Flimit the cost of essential items -
OL,9,Fsuch as milk, eggs, cheese and rice -
OL,10,Fto ease the cost of living.
